    "updated_at": "2026-01-22T19:26:35Z",
    "body": "A couple of other things to check (basically I defer to Document Policy experts):\r\n\r\nIs the current behavior of Document Policy of the spec and (Chromium) implementation aligned with Policy Container?\r\nWorker-related inheritance is a new thing added by this PR, but how about the existing inheritance e.g. iframes? e.g. https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#determining-navigation-params-policy-container inherits the Policy Container for `srcdoc` iframes, data: URL iframes etc. Is this the same behavior of the current Document Policy?\r\n\r\nDo we need to update the Document Policy spec as well? Maybe trivial (rerouting \"Document's document policy\" to \"Document's policy container's document policy\" etc.), maybe not.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "reactions": {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/html/issues/comments/3786289271/reactions",
      "total_count": 0,
