    "body": "@hiroshige-g Thanks! From what I can see, Chromium matches the current Document Policy spec.\r\n\r\nFor special iframe cases (srcdoc, data:), the implementation appears to inherit the parent document policy, with Require-Document-Policy / iframe policy acting only as a constraint (i.e. enforcing compatibility, not setting policy). Network iframes derive policy from response headers.\r\n\r\n@clelland can you confirm on this and your thoughts on hiroshige's comments.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
