    "created_at": "2026-06-16T18:25:57Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-06-16T18:25:57Z",
    "body": "I think that concern still applies. Document Policy hasn’t materially changed in that regard, and multi-vendor traction remains limited. This PR doesn’t change that.\r\n\r\n@domfarolino Given that DP inheritance (especially for local/iframe cases) doesn’t align with policy container semantics today, what do you think the right next steps are here? Should we resolve these first, or is there a path to proceed safely?",
    "author_association": "NONE",
